{
  "file": "module4",
  "page": 199,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.3412475585938,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "results from the two cohort studies showed that in-person treatment support was not better than VST.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.974120140075684,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.3803100585938,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "Treatment support has been the standard of care that many programmes aim for, even if in practice",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.3838500976562,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "they have to resort to SAT for many patients because of lack of resources. The advantages of using",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.4540405273438,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "VST are its potential to observe adherence to treatment from a distance – even when people travel",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        527.6320190429688,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "and cannot visit or be visited by a treatment support provider. VST is also more flexible with regard to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.992096900939941,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        133.3907012939453,
        527.3097534179688,
        147.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "people’s schedules as it offers virtual observation at different times of the day. VST could help achieve",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.987493515014648,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.59071350097656,
        527.1923217773438,
        161.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "better levels of patient interaction at a much lower cost and less inconvenience when compared",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        159.7907257080078,
        527.4389038085938,
        174.2337188720703
      ],
      "text": "with in-person treatment support. VST can be used in addition to, or may be interchangeable with,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        172.99073791503906,
        527.0968627929688,
        187.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "in-person treatment support or other treatment administration options. For instance, it is not expected",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.962335586547852,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        186.1907501220703,
        527.4410400390625,
        200.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "that a patient receives VST as the sole option of supervision during the whole duration of treatment.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        207.8946075439453,
        527.429931640625,
        222.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "Furthermore, the technology required for VST (broadband Internet and smartphone availability) is",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        221.09474182128906,
        527.3487548828125,
        235.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "becoming increasingly available in resource-constrained settings. Moreover, VST delivery options are",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.993648529052734,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        234.29469299316406,
        527.4343872070312,
        248.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "evolving (e.g. enhanced possibility for real-time communication in addition to recorded video), and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        247.4947052001953,
        527.4400634765625,
        261.9377136230469
      ],
      "text": "therefore evidence and best practices are likely to develop further in the coming years, especially",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        260.6947021484375,
        527.4266357421875,
        275.1377258300781
      ],
      "text": "from the ongoing randomized controlled trials. The benefits of VST may become more apparent",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        273.89459228515625,
        527.3838500976562,
        288.3376159667969
      ],
      "text": "as programmes are able to choose forms of VST that best meet their needs. In fact, VST may be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        287.0947265625,
        527.256103515625,
        301.5377502441406
      ],
      "text": "particularly useful for easing the burden on the health-care system in low- and middle-income",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        300.294677734375,
        115.10809326171875,
        314.7377014160156
      ],
      "text": "countries.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        331.1385192871094,
        383.3461608886719,
        346.79852294921875
      ],
      "text": "Package of combined treatment adherence interventions",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        352.7304992675781,
        527.4292602539062,
        368.44952392578125
      ],
      "text": "(91–96) (56–62, 97) Both randomized controlled trials  and observational studies   examined the effects",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        367.2065124511719,
        527.21533203125,
        381.6495361328125
      ],
      "text": "of combined treatment adherence interventions. When patients receiving combined treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        380.406494140625,
        527.2574462890625,
        394.8495178222656
      ],
      "text": "adherence interventions along with treatment support or SAT were compared to those receiving",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        393.60650634765625,
        527.3607177734375,
        408.0495300292969
      ],
      "text": "treatment support or SAT alone, the patients who received the combined treatment adherence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        406.8065185546875,
        527.3541259765625,
        421.2495422363281
      ],
      "text": "interventions had higher rates of treatment success, treatment completion, cure and adherence,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        420.0065002441406,
        527.4058837890625,
        434.44952392578125
      ],
      "text": "and lower rates of mortality and loss to follow-up. The mixture of types of adherence intervention",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        433.0965270996094,
        527.3927612304688,
        447.6495361328125
      ],
      "text": "Table 1 was varied ( ). These included different combinations of patient education, staff education,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        446.406494140625,
        527.176513671875,
        460.8495178222656
      ],
      "text": "material support (e.g. food, financial incentives, transport fees, bonuses for reaching treatment goals),",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.974821090698242,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        459.60650634765625,
        527.4224853515625,
        474.0495300292969
      ],
      "text": "psychological support and counselling. The treatment adherence interventions also included tracers",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        472.8065185546875,
        527.407958984375,
        487.2495422363281
      ],
      "text": "such as home visits, use of digital health communication (e.g. SMS, telephone calls) or a medication",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        486.0065002441406,
        527.221923828125,
        500.44952392578125
      ],
      "text": "monitor. Interventions should be selected on the basis of an assessment of individual patients’ needs,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.994499206542969,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        499.2065124511719,
        326.3907165527344,
        513.6495361328125
      ],
      "text": "providers’ resources and conditions for implementation.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        323.2414855957031,
        801.0170288085938,
        556.099609375,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "Chapter 3 Tuberculosis care and support: Recommendations 185",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}